    "text": "By WGLT ,\n1 days ago The recycling rate in McLean County is not as high as an environmental nonprofit had hoped and worked for leading up to 2026. The Ecology Action Center [EAC] has announced the 2025 waste generation and recycling rate of the county was 41%, and the rate of the year before was actually 43%. Read full article",
